Robert McNamara,
the man who commissioned
ໂຣເບີດ ແມັກນາມາຣາ, ຜູ້ຊາຍທີ່ສັ່ງໃຫ້

1103
01:00:32,167 --> 01:00:33,986
-this study--he's one of about
